<section class="chapter">
	<div class="wrap">
		<h1 class="display">Flood Relief Nepal</h1>
		<p class="lede">
			<b>One website for official Nepal flood relief.</b>{' '}
			After the Bhotekoshi flood in Rasuwa, the government asked everyone to send cash and supplies through its one-door system. This page points you there.
		</p>
		<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 md:gap-5">
			<a class="btn" href={site.official.pmdrf} rel="noopener noreferrer">Donate through the government</a>
			<a class="btn-ghost" href="#policy">How the one-door system works</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
